# 统一样式：避免跨平台/编辑器造成整文件变更
# 新前端的存档导出固定为 LF + UTF-8 无 BOM，这里与之一致
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# 数据与网页强制 LF
*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf